```
{{ github_repo.split('/') | last }}/
├── lib/
│   ├── {{ package_name }}.dart{{ ' ' * (21 - (package_name | length) - 5) }}# public API — the only file consumers import
│   └── src/rust/            # FRB-generated bindings (do NOT hand-edit)
